  "duration_s": 357.17,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您有没有想过，咱们中国古代那些如雷贯耳的地名？要是搁到今天，您还能认出来几个长安洛阳、金陵、广陵、光念这几个名字是不是就觉得有味儿？可我要是告诉您这些名字，十个里头有九个，现在都和原来不一样，您信吗？有人说长安没改啊，还叫长安。有人说洛阳没改啊，还叫洛阳，错，长安，现在叫西安，洛阳，虽然还叫洛阳，可它早不是那个天下之中的洛阳了，十个最有名的古地名，到今天只有一个完完整整的留了下来，名字没改，地位没详，位置没挪就一个。您猜是哪个？今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大地名，看看他们现在都叫什么了。最后告诉您这个唯一没改名的是谁觉得有意思的朋友先收藏，免得刷着刷着找不到了。老规矩，开奖之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第十名，朝歌改旗限朝歌。商朝的都城纣王在朝歌，妲己在朝歌比干在朝歌姬子在朝歌封神演义里的故事，大半在朝歌，朝歌这两个字，念出来就带着一股王朝气。朝歌是商朝晚期的政治中心，是当时全世界最大的城市之一。您想想，三千多年前，朝歌成里车水马龙，宫殿连着宫殿，可后来朝歌没了，改成了祁县。为什么改？因为境内有一条齐河就叫祁县了，一个商朝的都城，现在叫祁县。您走进去找朝歌找不到了。您说这是改名还是改？忘了第九名，陈仓改宝鸡，明修栈道，暗度陈仓。这句话读过三国的都知道，陈仓是韩信帮刘邦打天下的时候最关键的一个地方。韩信表面上修栈道吸引敌人注意，暗地里从陈仓小道杀出来，一举拿下关中。陈仓这个名字用了一千多年，可到了唐朝，唐玄宗做了一个梦，梦见老子显圣给他托梦，说陈仓这个地方有神机，唐玄宗醒了以后，觉得这是天遵义就把陈仓改成了宝鸡、宝鸡、宝鸡一只宝贝鸡从陈从军事重镇变成了吉祥物，您说这是改名还是改运？第八名，长山改石家庄常山赵子龙这句话读过三国的都知道，赵云一出场就是常山真定人长坂坡七进七出，怀里抱着阿斗手里一杆亮银枪杀的曹操八十万大军人仰马翻。长山这两个字就是赵云的招牌。常山在汉朝的时候是郡管着真定，就是今天的正定。可后来长山改了，改成石家庄。石家庄赵子龙，您品品一个在长坂坡杀的七进七出的常胜将军，报出名号来是石家庄人，这是怎么听怎么别扭？第七名，琅琊改临沂琅琊这两个字不用多解释。琅琊榜大家都知道，琅琊是诸葛亮的故乡，是王羲之的故乡，琅琊王氏中国历史上最牛的家族之一。王导王敦、王羲之全是从琅琊出来的，琅琊念出来就带着名士的风骨。可后来琅琊改了，改成琅琊王沂靠近怡和名字。没错，可琅琊那个味道没了。您说这是改地名还是改家风？第六名，兰陵改枣庄兰陵这两个字有多美？兰陵美酒郁金香，玉碗盛来琥珀光。李白写的兰陵是兰陵王高长宫的封地兰陵王。中国古代四大美男之一打仗的时候，他带着一个狰狞的面具，因为他长得太好看，怕敌人不怕他。这样一个地方，后来改了改成什么呢？枣庄枣树的庄，一个美男，一座美城，最后变成了一个种枣的庄子，您说这是改名还是改脸？从第十到第六，朝歌遍其县，陈仓变宝鸡、长山变石家庄、琅琊变临沂、兰陵变枣庄。可这五个还不是最可惜的。接下来第五到第一，一个比一个让人心疼，有一座城，以前叫金陵，现在叫南京。有一座城以前叫幽州，现在叫北京，还有一座城以前叫广陵，现在叫扬州，他是哪座，他凭什么排第一下集马上更新。您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 1170,
      "text": "您有没有想过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1490,
      "end_ms": 4830,
      "text": "咱们中国古代那些如雷贯耳的地名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5410,
      "end_ms": 6750,
      "text": "要是搁到今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7130,
      "end_ms": 15650,
      "text": "您还能认出来几个长安洛阳、金陵、广陵、光念这几个名字是不是就觉得有味儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15950,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "可我要是告诉您这些名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18890,
      "end_ms": 20270,
      "text": "十个里头有九个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20550,
      "end_ms": 22110,
      "text": "现在都和原来不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22290,
      "end_ms": 23010,
      "text": "您信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23150,
      "end_ms": 24570,
      "text": "有人说长安没改啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24990,
      "end_ms": 25950,
      "text": "还叫长安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26990,
      "end_ms": 28470,
      "text": "有人说洛阳没改啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29130,
      "end_ms": 29935,
      "text": "还叫洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30400,
      "end_ms": 30640,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00014",
      "start_ms": 31500,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00015",
      "start_ms": 32020,
      "end_ms": 33100,
      "text": "现在叫西安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34260,
      "end_ms": 34700,
      "text": "洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00017",
      "start_ms": 34700,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "虽然还叫洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00018",
      "start_ms": 35940,
      "end_ms": 38600,
      "text": "可它早不是那个天下之中的洛阳了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38880,
      "end_ms": 40640,
      "text": "十个最有名的古地名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41140,
      "end_ms": 44940,
      "text": "到今天只有一个完完整整的留了下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00021",
      "start_ms": 45340,
      "end_ms": 46200,
      "text": "名字没改，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00022",
      "start_ms": 46360,
      "end_ms": 47160,
      "text": "地位没详，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 50100,
      "text": "位置没挪就一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00024",
      "start_ms": 50460,
      "end_ms": 51540,
      "text": "您猜是哪个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00025",
      "start_ms": 52040,
      "end_ms": 56320,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大地名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00026",
      "start_ms": 56520,
      "end_ms": 58360,
      "text": "看看他们现在都叫什么了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00027",
      "start_ms": 58840,
      "end_ms": 64840,
      "text": "最后告诉您这个唯一没改名的是谁觉得有意思的朋友先收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00028",
      "start_ms": 65020,
      "end_ms": 66745,
      "text": "免得刷着刷着找不到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67020,
      "end_ms": 67535,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67750,
      "end_ms": 68415,
      "text": "开奖之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68650,
      "end_ms": 70605,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70910,
      "end_ms": 73545,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00033",
      "start_ms": 74670,
      "end_ms": 75275,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00034",
      "start_ms": 76220,
      "end_ms": 79255,
      "text": "朝歌改旗限朝歌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00035",
      "start_ms": 80110,
      "end_ms": 84435,
      "text": "商朝的都城纣王在朝歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85130,
      "end_ms": 91535,
      "text": "妲己在朝歌比干在朝歌姬子在朝歌封神演义里的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00037",
      "start_ms": 92540,
      "end_ms": 93725,
      "text": "大半在朝歌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00038",
      "start_ms": 94630,
      "end_ms": 95955,
      "text": "朝歌这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96940,
      "end_ms": 99955,
      "text": "念出来就带着一股王朝气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00040",
      "start_ms": 100830,
      "end_ms": 104275,
      "text": "朝歌是商朝晚期的政治中心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105120,
      "end_ms": 108005,
      "text": "是当时全世界最大的城市之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00042",
      "start_ms": 108620,
      "end_ms": 109275,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00043",
      "start_ms": 109890,
      "end_ms": 111155,
      "text": "三千多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00044",
      "start_ms": 111500,
      "end_ms": 113355,
      "text": "朝歌成里车水马龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00045",
      "start_ms": 114060,
      "end_ms": 115375,
      "text": "宫殿连着宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00046",
      "start_ms": 115980,
      "end_ms": 117715,
      "text": "可后来朝歌没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00047",
      "start_ms": 118270,
      "end_ms": 119465,
      "text": "改成了祁县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00048",
      "start_ms": 120120,
      "end_ms": 120840,
      "text": "为什么改？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00049",
      "start_ms": 121440,
      "end_ms": 125400,
      "text": "因为境内有一条齐河就叫祁县了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00050",
      "start_ms": 126060,
      "end_ms": 127480,
      "text": "一个商朝的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00051",
      "start_ms": 128100,
      "end_ms": 129340,
      "text": "现在叫祁县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00052",
      "start_ms": 130120,
      "end_ms": 134500,
      "text": "您走进去找朝歌找不到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00053",
      "start_ms": 134800,
      "end_ms": 137180,
      "text": "您说这是改名还是改？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00054",
      "start_ms": 137180,
      "end_ms": 138800,
      "text": "忘了第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00055",
      "start_ms": 139220,
      "end_ms": 140600,
      "text": "陈仓改宝鸡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00056",
      "start_ms": 141000,
      "end_ms": 142100,
      "text": "明修栈道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00057",
      "start_ms": 142320,
      "end_ms": 143360,
      "text": "暗度陈仓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00058",
      "start_ms": 144380,
      "end_ms": 146640,
      "text": "这句话读过三国的都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00059",
      "start_ms": 147120,
      "end_ms": 152770,
      "text": "陈仓是韩信帮刘邦打天下的时候最关键的一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00060",
      "start_ms": 153250,
      "end_ms": 157390,
      "text": "韩信表面上修栈道吸引敌人注意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00061",
      "start_ms": 157889,
      "end_ms": 160610,
      "text": "暗地里从陈仓小道杀出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00062",
      "start_ms": 160990,
      "end_ms": 162590,
      "text": "一举拿下关中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00063",
      "start_ms": 163150,
      "end_ms": 165930,
      "text": "陈仓这个名字用了一千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00064",
      "start_ms": 166370,
      "end_ms": 167310,
      "text": "可到了唐朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00065",
      "start_ms": 167690,
      "end_ms": 169110,
      "text": "唐玄宗做了一个梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00066",
      "start_ms": 169650,
      "end_ms": 172570,
      "text": "梦见老子显圣给他托梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00067",
      "start_ms": 173130,
      "end_ms": 175570,
      "text": "说陈仓这个地方有神机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00068",
      "start_ms": 176610,
      "end_ms": 178090,
      "text": "唐玄宗醒了以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00069",
      "start_ms": 178910,
      "end_ms": 191040,
      "text": "觉得这是天遵义就把陈仓改成了宝鸡、宝鸡、宝鸡一只宝贝鸡从陈从军事重镇变成了吉祥物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191400,
      "end_ms": 194100,
      "text": "您说这是改名还是改运？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00071",
      "start_ms": 194620,
      "end_ms": 195300,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00072",
      "start_ms": 195800,
      "end_ms": 201040,
      "text": "长山改石家庄常山赵子龙这句话读过三国的都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00073",
      "start_ms": 201260,
      "end_ms": 206300,
      "text": "赵云一出场就是常山真定人长坂坡七进七出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00074",
      "start_ms": 206520,
      "end_ms": 213180,
      "text": "怀里抱着阿斗手里一杆亮银枪杀的曹操八十万大军人仰马翻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00075",
      "start_ms": 214140,
      "end_ms": 217260,
      "text": "长山这两个字就是赵云的招牌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00076",
      "start_ms": 218140,
      "end_ms": 222400,
      "text": "常山在汉朝的时候是郡管着真定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00077",
      "start_ms": 222620,
      "end_ms": 224020,
      "text": "就是今天的正定。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00078",
      "start_ms": 224540,
      "end_ms": 226540,
      "text": "可后来长山改了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00079",
      "start_ms": 226840,
      "end_ms": 228020,
      "text": "改成石家庄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00080",
      "start_ms": 228360,
      "end_ms": 229460,
      "text": "石家庄赵子龙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00081",
      "start_ms": 229760,
      "end_ms": 234720,
      "text": "您品品一个在长坂坡杀的七进七出的常胜将军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00082",
      "start_ms": 234880,
      "end_ms": 237180,
      "text": "报出名号来是石家庄人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00083",
      "start_ms": 237440,
      "end_ms": 239785,
      "text": "这是怎么听怎么别扭？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00084",
      "start_ms": 240960,
      "end_ms": 241700,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00085",
      "start_ms": 242740,
      "end_ms": 246420,
      "text": "琅琊改临沂琅琊这两个字不用多解释。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00086",
      "start_ms": 246700,
      "end_ms": 248520,
      "text": "琅琊榜大家都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00087",
      "start_ms": 248880,
      "end_ms": 250540,
      "text": "琅琊是诸葛亮的故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00088",
      "start_ms": 250800,
      "end_ms": 252220,
      "text": "是王羲之的故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00089",
      "start_ms": 252660,
      "end_ms": 256220,
      "text": "琅琊王氏中国历史上最牛的家族之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00090",
      "start_ms": 256980,
      "end_ms": 261980,
      "text": "王导王敦、王羲之全是从琅琊出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00091",
      "start_ms": 262260,
      "end_ms": 265440,
      "text": "琅琊念出来就带着名士的风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00092",
      "start_ms": 265980,
      "end_ms": 267900,
      "text": "可后来琅琊改了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00093",
      "start_ms": 268060,
      "end_ms": 272910,
      "text": "改成琅琊王沂靠近怡和名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00094",
      "start_ms": 272910,
      "end_ms": 273310,
      "text": "没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273450,
      "end_ms": 275290,
      "text": "可琅琊那个味道没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00096",
      "start_ms": 275490,
      "end_ms": 278030,
      "text": "您说这是改地名还是改家风？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00097",
      "start_ms": 278830,
      "end_ms": 279530,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00098",
      "start_ms": 279930,
      "end_ms": 285150,
      "text": "兰陵改枣庄兰陵这两个字有多美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00099",
      "start_ms": 286130,
      "end_ms": 288010,
      "text": "兰陵美酒郁金香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00100",
      "start_ms": 288550,
      "end_ms": 290350,
      "text": "玉碗盛来琥珀光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00101",
      "start_ms": 290810,
      "end_ms": 295870,
      "text": "李白写的兰陵是兰陵王高长宫的封地兰陵王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00102",
      "start_ms": 295870,
      "end_ms": 299510,
      "text": "中国古代四大美男之一打仗的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00103",
      "start_ms": 299510,
      "end_ms": 301945,
      "text": "他带着一个狰狞的面具，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00104",
      "start_ms": 302370,
      "end_ms": 303575,
      "text": "因为他长得太好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00105",
      "start_ms": 304180,
      "end_ms": 305755,
      "text": "怕敌人不怕他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00106",
      "start_ms": 306090,
      "end_ms": 306970,
      "text": "这样一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00107",
      "start_ms": 307210,
      "end_ms": 309435,
      "text": "后来改了改成什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00108",
      "start_ms": 309660,
      "end_ms": 311140,
      "text": "枣庄枣树的庄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00109",
      "start_ms": 311400,
      "end_ms": 312195,
      "text": "一个美男，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00110",
      "start_ms": 312630,
      "end_ms": 313415,
      "text": "一座美城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00111",
      "start_ms": 313810,
      "end_ms": 315575,
      "text": "最后变成了一个种枣的庄子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00112",
      "start_ms": 315900,
      "end_ms": 318015,
      "text": "您说这是改名还是改脸？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00113",
      "start_ms": 318400,
      "end_ms": 319555,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00114",
      "start_ms": 320030,
      "end_ms": 321285,
      "text": "朝歌遍其县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00115",
      "start_ms": 321590,
      "end_ms": 327935,
      "text": "陈仓变宝鸡、长山变石家庄、琅琊变临沂、兰陵变枣庄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00116",
      "start_ms": 328550,
      "end_ms": 330785,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最可惜的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00117",
      "start_ms": 331620,
      "end_ms": 333115,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00118",
      "start_ms": 333470,
      "end_ms": 335005,
      "text": "一个比一个让人心疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00119",
      "start_ms": 335670,
      "end_ms": 336555,
      "text": "有一座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00120",
      "start_ms": 337130,
      "end_ms": 338315,
      "text": "以前叫金陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00121",
      "start_ms": 338860,
      "end_ms": 340105,
      "text": "现在叫南京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00122",
      "start_ms": 340910,
      "end_ms": 343305,
      "text": "有一座城以前叫幽州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00123",
      "start_ms": 343900,
      "end_ms": 345035,
      "text": "现在叫北京，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00124",
      "start_ms": 345860,
      "end_ms": 348325,
      "text": "还有一座城以前叫广陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00125",
      "start_ms": 348750,
      "end_ms": 349955,
      "text": "现在叫扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00126",
      "start_ms": 350300,
      "end_ms": 351000,
      "text": "他是哪座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00127",
      "start_ms": 351260,
      "end_ms": 353825,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00128",
      "start_ms": 354250,
      "end_ms": 355820,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_40dfda49e2ded977_s00129",
      "start_ms": 355820,
      "end_ms": 357045,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
